      "content": "i know, i should probably call them but they're closed until monday and im literally staring at the ceiling right now im so tired. i dont want to do anything crazy, just like a little extra to help me get through the night. like, if i just took a half dose of benadryl or a little extra seroquel, is that really gonna do anything bad? i feel like i know my body and i just need to sleep.",
